# File budget (ADR-056)

Hand-written files under `apps/` and `packages/` must stay ≤ **500** physical lines
unless listed in `config/file-budget-allowlist.txt` (AskQuestion to expand).

Complexity: Ruff C901 max 10 (`make file-complexity`); ESLint complexity 10 + max-lines 500
for frontend (shadcn `components/ui/` excluded).

Do not create new mega-files. Prefer SoC splits. Generated `iwxxm_xsd` / OpenAPI are excluded.

